## Activation

Before any task, check whether one of this plugin's skills applies (see `skills/`).
Follow the full conventions in `AGENTS.md`.

## Rules of thumb

- Skills follow the Agent Skills standard (`name` == directory, "Use when…" triggers).
- **CSO descriptions**: pure trigger format — no workflow, no outcome, no guidance.
- **Lifecycle metadata**: every skill has `metadata.lifecycle` in frontmatter.
- **TDD**: write test cases before implementing any skill. See `tests/` for patterns.
- Hooks ship bash + PowerShell variants.
- Users make key decisions only; the agent drives the workflow.
- **User perspective**: "user" always means the end user of this plugin's
  target project — optimize that project, never the generator (see AGENTS.md).

## Quick validation

```sh
npm run validate     # structural audit (Agent Skills standard)
npm test             # full test suite (must pass before release)
npm run lifecycle    # lifecycle probe audit
```